{% comment %}
  Step 1 of 5 — "Choose your concern". New step inserted between Entry and
  Doctor Select: after choosing "Book a consultation" on Entry, the visitor
  picks a specialization here first, THEN moves on to picking a doctor.
  Explicit instruction: this only applies to the consultation path — Therapy
  Slot's flow is untouched.

  Inserting this as the new step 1 pushed every downstream step's progress
  dots/label down by one (Doctor Select 1/5->2/5, Slot Picker 2/5->3/5,
  Patient Details 3/5->4/5) — Confirmation was already 5/5 (last of 5) so it
  needed no change. See kal-booking-flow.js's goToStep comment / each step's
  own header for the renumbering.

  This step is a structured replacement for a free-text "what are you
  coming in for" field, not a doctor filter/search — so each row is just an
  icon + name + radio, no doctor count. Selecting a specialization doesn't
  filter the Doctor Select list that follows; it still shows its same
  static 3 doctors regardless of what's picked here.

  General Medicine is pre-selected by default, matching the banner copy
  below it ("Not sure? General Medicine will guide you from there.").

  Icons are the 7 'concern-*' entries in kal-booking-icons.liquid, extracted
  from a sprite-sheet export — see that file's comment for how.

  Desktop composition: no Figma spec was given for this screen (mobile-only
  export), so it's built to match the other steps' desktop treatment exactly
  — reuses .kal-step-doctor-select__desktop/__panel directly (same shared
  grid/panel rule as Slot Picker/Patient Details/Confirmation, not a
  separate kal-step-concern-select__desktop/__panel copy) and
  .kal-step-entry__info for the left column, same convention as every other
  step's desktop composition in this build.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="kal-step-concern-select">

  {%- comment -%} ============ MOBILE ONLY (below 750px) ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-concern-select__mobile">

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__header">
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__back" data-kal-back="entry" aria-label="Back">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'chevron-left' -%}
      </button>
      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress">
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot--active"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-text">1/5</span>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%} Own close button — see Doctor Select's header comment for why {%- endcomment -%}
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__back" data-kal-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Same flex:1 scroll-wrapper pattern Doctor Select uses — with 7 rows
      this list is tall enough to risk pushing the Continue button off-frame
      on shorter viewports, same reason that fix was needed there.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__scroll">
      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__intro">
        <h2 class="kal-step-doctor-select__heading">Choose your concern</h2>
        <p class="kal-step-doctor-select__subtext">We&rsquo;ll match you with available doctors.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-concern-select__list">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-general-medicine', name: 'General Medicine', concern_key: 'general-medicine', selected: true -%}
        {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-orthopedics', name: 'Orthopedics', concern_key: 'orthopedics', selected: false -%}
        {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-gastroenterology', name: 'Gastroenterology', concern_key: 'gastroenterology', selected: false -%}
        {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-gynecology', name: 'Gynecology', concern_key: 'gynecology', selected: false -%}
        {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-cardiology', name: 'Cardiology', concern_key: 'cardiology', selected: false -%}
        {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-pediatrics', name: 'Pediatrics', concern_key: 'pediatrics', selected: false -%}
        {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-neurology', name: 'Neurology', concern_key: 'neurology', selected: false -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__footer">
      <div class="kal-concern-select__banner">
        <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--info">
          {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'info' -%}
        </span>
        <span class="kal-concern-select__banner-text">Not sure? General Medicine will guide you from there.</span>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-goto="doctor-select">
        Continue
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ============ DESKTOP (750px and up) ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__desktop">
    <div class="kal-step-entry__info">
      <div class="kal-step-entry__info-content">
        <h2 class="kal-step-entry__heading">Choose your concern</h2>
        <p class="kal-step-entry__body-text">
          We&rsquo;ll match you with available doctors. Book a consultation
          in under a minute in-clinic or video.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="kal-step-entry__location">
        <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
          <!-- ICON: location-pin (not received yet) -->
        </span>
        <span class="kal-step-entry__location-text">
          Kerala Ayurveda Wellness Center, Kormangala &middot; Opens 8 AM
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__panel">
      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress kal-step-doctor-select__progress--desktop">
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot--active"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-text">1/5</span>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-step-concern-select__scroll">
        <div class="kal-concern-select__list">
          {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-general-medicine', name: 'General Medicine', concern_key: 'general-medicine', selected: true -%}
          {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-orthopedics', name: 'Orthopedics', concern_key: 'orthopedics', selected: false -%}
          {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-gastroenterology', name: 'Gastroenterology', concern_key: 'gastroenterology', selected: false -%}
          {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-gynecology', name: 'Gynecology', concern_key: 'gynecology', selected: false -%}
          {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-cardiology', name: 'Cardiology', concern_key: 'cardiology', selected: false -%}
          {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-pediatrics', name: 'Pediatrics', concern_key: 'pediatrics', selected: false -%}
          {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-concern-row', icon_name: 'concern-neurology', name: 'Neurology', concern_key: 'neurology', selected: false -%}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__desktop-footer">
        <div class="kal-concern-select__banner">
          <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--info">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'info' -%}
          </span>
          <span class="kal-concern-select__banner-text">Not sure? General Medicine will guide you from there.</span>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-goto="doctor-select">
          Continue
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
